  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aida Niang Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project leader is a cooperative made up of women and men, located in the Wilaya of Trarza. It is registered and has an essentially agricultural vocation. It is made up of 260 members, the vast majority of whom are women (240) and some of their members (150) have an age range of between 15 and 35 years. It has a significant land potential of 35 ha, 5 of which are fenced. , close to their village and its lands are fertile and accessible.</narrative>
  </description>
